<< /Alt (The organisation of content diagram consists of a central circle showing the Working Scientifically skills: Questioning and Predicting, Planning Investigations, Conducting Investigations, Processing Data and Information, Analysing Data and Information, Problem Solving, and Communicating. The central circle is surrounded by a ring divided in into the Year 11 and Year 12 modules. The Year 11 modules are: Module 1 Kinematics, Module 2 Dynamics, Module 3 Waves and Thermodynamics and Module 4 Electricity and Magnetism. The Year 12 modules are: Module 5 Advanced Mechanics, Module 6 Electromagnetism, Module 7 The Nature of Light and Module 8 From the Universe to the Atom.) /K [ 9 ] /P 159 0 R /Pg 45 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
